  "bodyHash": "1781fed6c4f97f06",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=X&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">溢出状态栏</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 将《我的世界》的生命值、护甲值和护甲韧性条扩展至原版上限之外，同时保持紧凑易读。该模组不会添加额外的图标行，而是将状态栏堆叠为清晰的层级，占用空间大幅减少。📊</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">当你的属性超过原版限制时，行数计数器会精确显示你当前拥有多少层生命值、护甲或韧性。无需记忆配色方案或猜测当前查看的是哪一层。🔢</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">该模组还添加了专门的护甲韧性条，将一项原版未显示的重要防御属性带入游戏界面。🛡️</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">为了正确支持超出原版上限的护甲和韧性数值，请安装 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/attributefix\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">AttributeFix（属性修复）</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，作者为 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/DarkhaxDev\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">DarkhaxDev</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。🌟</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">❤️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">紧凑的生命值显示：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 生命值超过十颗心时，直接在原有位置堆叠，无需在 HUD 中添加额外行。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">突破原版上限的护甲显示：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 高护甲数值依然能清晰展示，且仅占用必要空间。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💎 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">护甲韧性专用条：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 新增独立的韧性显示条，让你随时掌握这一关键防御属性。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔢 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">清晰的层级计数：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 每个堆叠状态栏均可显示数字指示器，精确标明当前存在的层数。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">易于辨识的配色：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 基础层使用原版颜色，堆叠层使用单一高亮色，避免令人困惑的彩虹渐变效果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📏 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">节省空间的 HUD：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 即使生命值、护甲或韧性数值极高，界面依然保持紧凑。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💬 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">聊天兼容修复：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 防止聊天消息遮挡与护甲相关的 HUD 元素。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可自定义布局：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 可调整位置、堆叠方式、计数器及显示选项，以匹配你偏好的 HUD 设置。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客户端必须安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（适用于 Fabric 和 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（适用于 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（适用于 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模组支持配置，可直接在游戏内通过模组菜单进行设置（Fabric 端需安装由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 开发的 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若使用外部文本编辑器进行手动配置，所有文件均位于 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 目录下，文件名分别为 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，具体取决于配置类型。并非所有模组都会包含全部类型的配置文件。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/locusway\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">LocusWay</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 及其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overpowered-armor-bar\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Overpowered Armor Bar</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模组，其分层护甲条设计为本模组提供了灵感。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Vazkii\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Vazkii</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 及其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Quark</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模组，其护甲与韧性叠加图标设计为本模组提供了灵感。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/cadaverous_queen\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">cadaverous_queen</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 及其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rustic\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Rustic</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模组，其护甲韧性图标及该状态栏的原始创意。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mdiyo\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">mDiyo</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 及其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mantle\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mantle</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模组，其最初提出的堆叠爱心显示方案。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/diagonal-windows\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwindows/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/new-health-bars\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/healthbars/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/visual-workbench\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/visualworkbench/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
